my-maven-project/
src/main/java/                  // application source code
src/main/resources/             // config, static files
src/test/java/                  // unit + integration tests
src/test/resources/             // test resource files
pom.xml                         // Project Object Model: dependencies, plugins, build
target/                         // build output (generated)
.mvn/, mvnw, mvnw.cmd           // Maven Wrapper (optional)
README.md


package-by-layer vs package-by-feature
    - layers
        - UI Layer
        - Service Layer
        - DAO Layer
        - Entity Layer
        - Database Layer

    - Dependencies point one way, Controller -> Service -> Repo

DTO Package structure
    - Data Transfer Objects move data between layers or across application boundaries without exposing entities
    - Request DTOS validate input at the boundary; Response DTOs expose only what the client needs


